cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  SequenceJacobian.jl is a Julia port of the Python toolbox sequence-jacobian.
  If you use it, please cite the paper by Auclert, Bardóczy, Rognlie and Straub
  (preferred citation below). You may also mention this port.
title: "SequenceJacobian.jl: a Julia port of the sequence-jacobian toolbox"
type: software
